		<div data-particle_enable="false" data-particle-mobile-disabled="false" class="elementor-element elementor-element-8465326 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="8465326" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-9417a1e elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="9417a1e" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
					<h1 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Saarrthi Group – Leading Real Estate Developers in Pune | Shaping Modern Living</h1>				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-22afa46 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="22afa46" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									Saarrthi Group is one of Pune’s leading real estate developers, recognized for its unwavering commitment to quality, innovation, and trust. With a strong legacy spanning decades, we have successfully delivered a diverse portfolio of residential and commercial projects across prime locations in Pune.								</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-041bdb6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="041bdb6" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									At Saarrthi Group, we are more than just Pune real estate developers — we are visionaries shaping the city’s skyline. With expertise in crafting 1 BHK, 2 BHK, and 3 BHK flats in Pune, we design homes that balance comfort, sustainability, and community living. As one of the most reliable names in Pune real estate, we focus on delivering the best properties in Pune that provide unmatched lifestyle and secure investment opportunities in Pune.								</div>
				</div>
		<div data-particle_enable="false" data-particle-mobile-disabled="false" class="elementor-element elementor-element-8618f4c e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child" data-id="8618f4c" data-element_type="container" data-e-type="container">
